00:19:29.011 --> 00:19:30.490
I'll try to be brief here.

00:19:30.491 --> 00:19:33.400
The main messages is on
network decomposition.

00:19:33.401 --> 00:19:35.280
What is that?

00:19:35.281 --> 00:19:38.250
While the job, I
like the CEO's job,

00:19:38.251 --> 00:19:42.380
you've got a great one
and Victor is to sort of

00:19:42.381 --> 00:19:43.990
