as I extend to the Edge,

01:21:03.061 --> 01:21:05.340
and do I have to
trust the hardware?

01:21:05.341 --> 01:21:06.660
Do I have to trust
some other third party?

01:21:06.661 --> 01:21:08.030
Is Microsoft going to have

01:21:08.031 --> 01:21:10.575
